# Copy to .env.test and fill in. Gitignored — never commit real credentials.
#
# A Clerk user in your DEV instance who already belongs to an organization.
# Without one the console redirects to /create-agency and no test reaches the
# roster; the setup checks this and says so rather than letting every test
# fail at the sign-in screen.
#
# Clerk's own guidance is to use a dedicated test account, not a personal one.
E2E_CLERK_USER_USERNAME=

# No password is needed. Sign-in mints a short-lived sign-in TICKET with
# CLERK_SECRET_KEY (read from Lab-05/.env) because this instance has Client
# Trust enabled: a password sign-in from an unrecognised device waits for an
# emailed code, and a test browser is a new device every run. Tickets are
# passwordless, so Client Trust does not apply.
